# File Structure

- Creative artifacts live under: CONTEXT/, RESEARCH/, BRIEFS/, SCENARIOS/, MATRIX/, CANVA_OPS/, QA/, ARCHIVE/.
- Do not scatter briefs outside BRIEFS/; specs outside MATRIX/.
- EXPERTS/{title}/: seed.json (sourced only) + pending_research.json — no invented bios.
- Completed packages: move to ARCHIVE/YYYY-MM/ with manifest.
- Plans and phase docs: `.cursor/plans/` — not mixed into BRIEFS/.
